  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p>Trünk is changing how people make small moves around the USA and around the globe. Everyone moves: students, employees, military, and retirees. Anyone can use <a href=\"http://www.trunkmoves.com.\">www.trunkmoves.com.</a><a href=\"http://www.trunkmoves.com.\"></a>&nbsp; Currently, no other company matches the safety and security of patented container design. &nbsp;We offer very steep discounted pricing for shipping due to our contractual relationships with major carriers. Our claim frequency is 40x better than regualr box shipping services and &nbsp;which means we are in a category all our own. Our e-commerce based platform is simple, fully automated and powered by cutting-edge AI technology. All of this is what makes Trunkmoves so amazing.&nbsp;</p><p>About our containers: we are the only company to have a DuPont Award Winning crate that stores flat and is reusable. Strong as wood and light as paper, our containers are featured in DHL's Innovation Centers around the globe and employees of Google, Apple, Tesla, Facebook and many more use us to either ship their essentials as a small move through parcel shipping or as an advanced move of their essentials while they await their larger move.&nbsp;</p><p><br>Each time you refer a customer who books an essential move with Trünk, you'll be rewarded $25! And because you referred this new customer, they too will be rewarded with a discount of $25 off their booking. If you'd like to email us for further information, please do.</p></div>",
